---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact | Algorithmic Art Gallery by Jonathan R. Reed"
  description="Contact Jonathan R. Reed about the Algorithmic Art Gallery, generative art experiments, gallery feedback, accessibility issues, and project questions."
>
  <section class="info-page" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 id="contact-title">Contact about the Algorithmic Art Gallery.</h1>
    <p class="mono-text info-byline">
      Updated <time datetime="2026-08-04">August 4, 2026</time>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Feedback about the generator, saved pieces, export behavior, or
      accessibility goes through Jonathan R. Reed's portfolio contact channels.
    </p>
    <div class="info-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>Bugs and accessibility</h2>
        <p>
          Include the page URL, browser, device, and what you expected against
          what happened. For a visual bug, the seed, curve type, growth mode,
          palette, and export format. For accessibility, the interaction that
          got in the way: keyboard navigation, contrast, canvas preview, export
          controls, or the saved gallery.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Creative inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For commissions, collaborations, or gallery presentation questions,
          include the intended format, dimensions, deadline, whether it is
          headed for screen or print, and whether the work should stay fully
          deterministic from a documented seed.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="info-actions">
      <a href="https://jonathanrreed.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jonathan Reed</a>
      <a href="/">Open generator</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy notes</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
